  "_intent": "A dead freight yard in the desert. Tactical shells, jackknifed semi trailers and three gutted school buses, all of it at hard angles to everything else. The skill this map exists for is CROSSHAIR PLACEMENT in a place with too many angles to hold: every container corner is a lane, and you cannot pre-aim all of them, so you learn to pre-aim the one that matters.",
